    ___             ______________________________
    ___ WHAT IS IT? ______________________________

    predict is a portable C framework for embedded applications development.
    yupp lexical preprocessor (https://github.com/in4lio/yupp/) is included as
    a Git submodule and requires Python 3.11 or newer.

    The framework contains:
    –  application template
    –  application state-space (data)
    –  coroutines (co)
    –  unit testing (ut)
    –  debug console (console)
    –  logging (log)
    –  configuration (ini)

    Supported platforms:
    –  Windows (MinGW)
    –  GNU/Linux
    –  DOS (DJGPP)
